{
  "slug": "helius",
  "name": "Helius",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Build on Solana with Helius — live blockchain tools, expert coding patterns, and autonomous account signup",
  "longDescription": "Ships **6 skills** and **2 MCP servers**.\n\n- **Skills** (6): `build` (Build Solana applications with Helius infrastructure), `dflow` (Build Solana trading applications combining DFlow trading APIs with Helius infrastructure), `jupiter` (Build Solana DeFi applications combining Jupiter APIs with Helius infrastructure), `okx` (Build Solana trading and intelligence applications combining OKX DEX aggregation with Helius infrastructure), `phantom` (Build frontend Solana applications with Phantom Connect SDK and Helius infrastructure), `svm` (Explore Solana's architecture and protocol internals)\n- **MCP servers** (2): `helius`, `DFlow`\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install helius@claude-community` from `helius-labs/core-ai` (`helius-plugin`).",
